From 66cdb41f130097261cb66e55178e2560aec00068 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taimoor Ul Islam <tislam@iastate.edu>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 18:50:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 30/54] kaiair: LDP deadline is now a LIVE ctrl-file overlay
 (ldp_deadline_ms), no restarts

The GUI LDP toggle previously restarted the agent + gNB; the dashboard's
hand-built agent env dropped KAIAIR_DL_SINR_CSI (and could drop everything),
so the restarted gNB expected 4-bit CSI while the UE sent the 10-bit report,
every CSI decode failed and RLF tore the link down ('powers off' symptom).
Now pktr_ldp_now() reads ldp_deadline_ms from the live control file (~2 Hz,
same overlay as gamma/power): scheduler gates, retx caps, delivery
classification and the metrics view all follow within a second, gNB PID
unchanged. Env KAIAIR_PKTR_DEADLINE_MS remains the no-overlay fallback.
